-- mod-dungeon-quests — the quest givers, at the entrance and at the end of
-- every dungeon.
--
-- The entrances: where the players arrive (areatrigger_teleport,
-- lfg_dungeon_template), most on the spots of the Dungeon-Quest-Pet module
-- (its Bryten Helper). The ends: beside the last boss of the dungeon
-- (instance_encounters), or of each wing; where that boss is summoned by its
-- script, beside the creature or chest that closes the dungeon. No end in the
-- Oculus (its last boss is fought on drakes, in the air) nor in the Violet
-- Hold (one room, by the entrance).
--
-- The quest giver settles on the ground when it appears (the module), so a
-- spot a little above the floor is harmless.
--
-- Guids 9460000-9469999: block 94600-94699 of the WoW-mods registry. Idempotent.

DELETE FROM `creature` WHERE `guid` BETWEEN 9460000 AND 9469999;
